1: BLACK BOX IS:
LVS BOX BLACK CELL1 CELL2 ..
LVS BLACK BOX PORT REALL_METAL_LAYER PIN_LAYER CONNECTION_LAYER

REAL_METAL_LAYER: such as M1i, Which means the metal do really exist for routing

PIN_LAYER: such as M1_pin, Which is declare by:
  "TEXT LAYER M1_pin ATTACH M1_pin metal1" 
  PORT LAYER TEXT M1_pin

connect layer is  the layer do really setup connection:
metal1 = M1i or M1dummy
connect metal1 metal2 by v1
